        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.92,
          "end": 59.4,
          "en": "and await the response here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.4,
          "end": 62.27,
          "en": "And then we need to insert the URL",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.27,
          "end": 64.473,
          "en": "to which we want to send the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.42,
          "end": 70.11,
          "en": "Now often that is some domain dot com",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.78,
          "end": 75.57,
          "en": "and then some path, if it's an external API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.57,
          "end": 78.66,
          "en": "but here it's of course an internal API,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 82.26,
          "en": "which will be hosted by the same server as is being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.26,
          "end": 84.15,
          "en": "for serving this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.15,
          "end": 88.84,
          "en": "And therefore we just can construct a absolute path here",
