        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.11,
          "end": 97.36,
          "en": "And the path is slash API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.36,
          "end": 101.15,
          "en": "because it's this special API folder and then the file name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.15,
          "end": 105.983,
          "en": "So slash meetup and you meet up without the file extension.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.33,
          "end": 110.09,
          "en": "And if you name this Java script file differently here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.09,
          "end": 112.773,
          "en": "you need to use a different name here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.78,
          "end": 115.28999999999999,
          "en": "This will now send the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.28999999999999,
          "end": 118.64,
          "en": "to this new meetup JS file in the API folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.64,
          "end": 120.98,
          "en": "And it will then trigger this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 120.98,
          "end": 123.95,
          "en": "NextJS will trigger this function for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 123.95,
          "end": 126.353,
          "en": "when a request reaches this path.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.89,
          "end": 131.05,
          "en": "Now we actually do need to send a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.05,
          "end": 132.8,
          "en": "because we're not doing anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.8,
          "end": 135.3,
          "en": "for different kinds of requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.3,
          "end": 138.17000000000002,
          "en": "And hence, here, we need to use this second argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.17000000000002,
          "end": 142.48,
          "en": "which we can pass to fetch to configure this request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.48,
          "end": 145.823,
          "en": "And for example, we can set the method key to post here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.81,
          "end": 148.6,
          "en": "We then should also at the body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
